WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Pineapple, Zinger, Biryulka

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
queen

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.920
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:15.200
No, that's not what I meant!

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.680
We'll have to take the extreme step.

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:39.350
And he's fast.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.780
-What is this?
- I have to ask you this.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.760
While I was drinking, I thought that the moonlight would be enough for my mood,

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:47.160
So I blew out the candle.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:53.300
I wanted to stretch my throat before I started drinking for real.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.770
You can consider this a warm-up.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:58.660
So, what?

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.880
What are you doing? Damn it.

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:04.740
Wasn't it you who wanted to warm each other's throats?

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:07.870
What a smart asshole. Did he do it on purpose?

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.380
No, it's impossible.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.760
Since we've warmed our throats,

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.590
start drinking heartily, my queen.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:19.730
Where?

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.020
One person is not interesting.

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:25.740
Somehow I didn't think about it.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.160
I'll pour it.

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:37.550
Thank you for the warm-up welcome,

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.570
Now the wine went smoothly.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:42.650
What? What did I do?

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.380
Here, have a drink.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:52.150
You must drink too, my queen.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.200
The king drinks first.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.400
No, the queen drinks first.

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:58.900
Changed strategy.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:02.130
I know your dark thoughts.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.810
Then let's have a glass

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:09.270
and to bed, fortunately it was a long day.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.770
What are you saying? Yes, we have just begun.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:13.920
Don't be like that.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:17.590
Come on. One salvo for my health.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:19.120
In one gulp.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.560
I'm a light sleeper

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.120
so stay away while we sleep.

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.900
What kind of game was he playing with such nonsense?

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:43.080
Blooms during the day, withers at night.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:50.780
These tales about the king's love for alcohol and women...

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.960
Chronicles about Joseon lie like the yellow press.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:57.680
I shouldn't have been scared.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:00.720
But we must not let down our guard.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.740
Finally using it

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.670
a woman's knot, which I learned in the army.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.400
If he wants to untie it, he will have to cut it.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.640
Frets.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.680
Damn selfish.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.650
Took up the whole bed.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.220
Sorry, my queen.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.990
I understand your feelings

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:40.430
but today I just want to sleep.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.940
Everything is wrong. I was raised in comfort

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:44.870
I can't sleep on the bare floor.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:46.580
Give me one.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:48.780
I can't sleep

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.080
less than three feather beds.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.470
I'm sure your comfort cannot compare with the royal one.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:01.520
This lumberjack prince from Ganghwa

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:02.860
Obviously I didn’t study history.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:22.640
Christmas trees.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.350
To break his sleep paralysis.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.250
Since things turned out this way,
I'll be on guard all night.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.950
For some reason today I still remember the army.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:57.310
Episode 2: Nobody Knows

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.470
Are you awake, Your Majesty?

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:59.110
Here's an ambush.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:02.180
I hoped not, but I'm still here.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.980
What is it like to greet a new day as a queen?

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.010
Shitty.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.120
There you go.

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:17.180
My woman's knot.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:24.030
Lost something again?

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.540
-I'll search everything...
-No!

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:31.740
I'm sure he untied it at night and got in the way, I suppose. So?

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.120
Your Majesty.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:21.720
When did you arrive in Hijeongjong?

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:24.560
Sorry for not accompanying you.

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:28.820
I didn’t want to wake the queen and quietly left.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:32.260
Are you having nightmares again?

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:37.130
She shouldn't lose sleep over me.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.310
It's her first day as queen.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:44.000
I will bring you Arabic jasmine tea and you will sleep well tonight.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:51.580
The Queen must now be greeting the ladies of the court.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.360
I heard they've already left.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:58.230
I wonder what the queen looks like now.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.170
The wedding was yesterday

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.940
Why didn’t I wake up in time, how are things going again?

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.010
You should go and greet

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.180
the Queen Dowager and the Queen Mother

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:16.500
and hold a festive ceremony for the court officials.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.810
After the official part of the wedding ceremony...

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:20.680
When will the wedding end?

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.990
No, then His Majesty must read the message

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.290
about your proclamation as queen.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:30.030
Some kind of endless wedding.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:34.160
Just a minute. So the Queen Dowager is...

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:37.330
This is the Queen Dowager's order.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:40.830
I'll fill the lake with water -
I will go against her orders.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:47.330
What kind of person is the Queen Dowager?

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.140
Dowager Queen

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.050
like you, from the Andon clan Kim, she is an elder,

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:55.520
and the queen mother is from the Pungyang Cho family.

00:09:57.250 --> 00:10:00.060
So my acquired granny and mommy are at enmity.

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:02.820
And I, the queen, am of the same kind as grandma.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.030
Can I ask her when I see her?

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:07.350
The older one is the Queen Dowager.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:09.460
What else?

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:14.800
It’s really important to me, will you tell me everything you know?

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.910
She is Mr. Kim Jwageun's sister

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:21.730
and has not left the palace since she arrived.

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:23.100
-Also...
-Stop.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.920
I'm talking about the palanquin. Stop!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:32.210
-Stop!
-Stand.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:37.930
Back.

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:40.930
Roll it back.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.060
Roll it back.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.670
Like this.

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:59.440
Something more important has emerged here.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:36.520
Got lost because the palace is too big?

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:43.890
Nice to meet you. What's your name?

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:49.690
That's it.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:53.060
I will never get used to this body.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.040
You have such an attractive aura.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.910
Are you from the royal family too?

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:05.150
Is there some kind of princess there?

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:07.750
My apologies.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:11.080
If I was arrogant and upset you,

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.580
Please forgive me.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:15.790
No. What I'm trying to say...

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:16.890
Your Majesty.

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:19.850
You walk so fast. How did you get here?

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.160
Hello.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:25.800
Do you know her?

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.540
This is Lady Hwajin of the Cho family,

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.540
future royal concubine.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.580
I understand that the queen

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.210
but didn't she insult you too much?

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.750
Continues to play with words.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.950
Rumor has it that she

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.550
pushed you into the lake.

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:44.790
I am sure that the rumor about the queen losing her memory is a lie.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.850
-Be careful.
-Be careful.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:59.400
I've met so many women

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.300
that I can easily read their faces.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.830
You... How should I say this?

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:07.470
Good man.

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:13.920
I guess we didn't work out in the past

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.710
so maybe we can start again?

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.650
I like you.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:20.810
Let's be friends.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.590
Have you decided to change tactics?

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:29.900
Tactics?

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:33.770
Thanks to you I learned
what is the palace like?

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:36.710
I was finally able to understand that I am now also a part of it.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.840
No, it looks like you misunderstood me.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.940
-It's not like that.
-Sorry, I have to go.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.310
Your Majesty!

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:49.840
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:53.360
I came to your chambers
but you weren't there.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.260
I wanted to greet you too, but I couldn’t find you.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.820
This is how we must have missed each other

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:01.190
because our thoughts converge.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.900
If she's a concubine
So it turns out that she is considered a second wife?

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.040
Why this body?

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.810
Why this?

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:16.200
The fire in the queen's eyes can burn the fields.

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:23.840
Rent yourself a room already!

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:25.840
My queen

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.680
please tell me as soon as possible
to the royal concubine what and how.

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:34.660
What a shame!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:37.600
I don't have time to explain everything to her here.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.960
This is the king's order.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:43.060
Fuck polygamy.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.680
Your Majesty!

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:50.010
The queens have been waiting for you for so long!

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.010
Your Majesty!

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:56.610
I have a very important meeting, I'll go.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:05.220
What the hell is this?

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:07.950
Your Majesty!

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.000
I was very scared

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.540
Hwajin?

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:20.930
Finally I can call you my wife.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.410
Now we will live together in the palace.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.150
You deserve a real wedding ceremony

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:31.840
but the eunuch saw you not far from the lake.

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:35.660
Officials are trying
blame you for what happened.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.930
So I had to speed up the selection.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:41.230
I was at the lake because I was scared

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.690
hearing a loud sound.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.590
Don't worry.

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:46.570
She can't hurt you

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.360
no matter what family she comes from.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:58.650
No, not like that.
I will do everything to keep you safe.

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:01.710
I will protect you with all my might.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:04.810
Your Majesty.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:08.420
Unfortunately, I have
there aren't many ways to do this.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.090
I'm just a puppet on a throne.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:13.090
But I have a brother who cares about me

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.220
and a friend who would do anything for fun.

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:16.590
And also

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.770
wonderful woman.

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.330
Yes, you are rich.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:33.220
I explained to the officials where you were.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.550
Don't worry.

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:51.030
What? Well, which one is the widowed granny?

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.140
Bow to the Queen Dowager, Your Majesty.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:55.430
Never mind, walk away flaw.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:00.930
I hope you slept soundly, Queen Dowager.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.990
You have become so much younger this night!

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:13.560
You can't tell how old you are.

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:16.390
You almost fooled me, Your Majesty.

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:18.260
Scoundrel.

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.630
Is it true?

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:23.590
So it’s not in vain that I’m trying so hard.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.670
Good job, Jang Bong Hwan, keep it up.

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:29.800
A great misfortune has happened to you.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.930
What a horror it seems
you haven't fully recovered yet.

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:36.200
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:39.150
We couldn't have found a better queen!

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.920
Just as sharp-tongued as ever.

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.310
Right.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.110
I looked closer and I see.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:50.980
They smile so sweetly, but in reality
They would rip each other's throats out.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.890
Full combat readiness.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:56.670
Now you have to do your best
try to produce an heir.

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:01.340
At one time I found out
effective way to do this

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:03.770
so that a little prince will definitely be born.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.210
Don't torment us.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:11.380
Imagine spending the night with your spouse.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:13.680
He lies on his back

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:14.810
and you on top...

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.360
Give her the "Best Mother-in-Law" award.

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:39.770
This is a very important point
climb on top and...

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:42.330
Mother, I can handle this very well myself!

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.080
Just shut up, I beg you.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:55.490
Well, let's just say I studied the literature carefully.

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:06.470
Smart girl!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:10.510
How many things have you learned?
to become a wonderful wife.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.310
I'm sure you are well aware.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:15.630
I agree,

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:19.810
I'm sorry I crossed the line.

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:25.110
This means that the daughter-in-law should be more modest,

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:29.520
and the grandson’s wife has to figure something out.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.010
What a nightmare!

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.570
Not sleeves, but murder weapons!

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:51.340
My neck is cracking.

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:53.950
You must be very tired.

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:55.520
No wonder

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.810
We had too much to drink last night.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.580
What did we drink there?

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.920
The courtiers are already waiting for us.

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.420
I suggest you hurry up.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.240
Injeongjeong Hall

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:52.010
State Councilor Kim Byung-hak.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.510
Congratulations.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:05.990
Left advisor Kim Seok-keun.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.560
Congratulations.

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:12.030
Minister of War Kim Chang-hyuk.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.800
Congratulations.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:15.530
And all the Kims.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:19.300
So that's what you are like,
the famous trio of Kims from Andong.

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:23.770
With the help of the Queen Dowager and the King's wife

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:26.940
they came up with
various pretexts for collecting taxes.

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:28.540
Because of them, the people suffered greatly.

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:30.850
In my time
they were accused of corruption in the defense sector

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.750
and real estate,
as well as tax evasion.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:34.580
Our arrows have ripened everywhere.

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.220
In other words, here it is, a trio of bastards,

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.750
a symbol of the corruption that has destroyed the country.

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.260
Andon clan Kim.

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:45.690
Right advisor Man-heon Cho.

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.730
Congratulations.

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:56.130
Minister of Officials Cho Dongmoon.

00:21:56.770 --> 00:21:58.440
Congratulations.

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:00.830
And here is the Cho family from Pungyang.

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.670
These are famous for holding
closer to the Queen Mother.

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:05.610
When her son Hongjong was king,

00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:07.620
they were held in high esteem, and then he passed away.

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:09.650
Kim So-yeon from the Andong family ascended the throne,

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:11.050
and they lost their influence.

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:15.720
Now they are just small fish.

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:17.430
The one who really means something is...

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:20.850
Troop commander Kim Jwageun.

00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:24.770
My congratulations, Your Majesty,

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:26.770
Your Majesties.

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:29.300
Here he is - the man
in whose hands is all the power of the Kim family.

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:33.940
Since we are here about your wedding,

00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:36.070
I would like to report something.

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:39.400
Speak.

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:41.950
Head of the Royal Guard
is responsible for your safety.

00:22:42.780 --> 00:22:46.110
I advise you to schedule this
position of Kim Moon-geun.

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:49.850
My father-in-law?

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:51.490
Right.

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:56.700
This is a very important post.

00:22:57.170 --> 00:23:00.360
The Queen is concerned about your safety.

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:03.330
I apologize for not mentioning this earlier.

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:06.810
Is this what you wished for?

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:08.600
God knows, but

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:11.600
I will stick with the winners.

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:15.720
Am I alive or dead
I will be concerned about your safety.

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.720
To make sure you are safe and healthy,
I didn't sleep all night.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:23.020
A snake, not a woman.

00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:29.320
That's it, then I agree.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:30.870
Dowager Queen

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:33.860
I was glad to hear about the queen's request.

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:36.470
My brother currently holds this position.

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:37.840
Prince Yeonpyeong.

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:39.840
I need time to think.

00:23:39.840 --> 00:23:42.570
Your safety comes first.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:47.950
Your Majesty, please make a decision

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:50.380
ASAP.

00:24:09.200 --> 00:24:13.040
Your love for me knows no bounds.

00:24:13.810 --> 00:24:17.480
Then, with your permission, I will continue.

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.120
Kim Jwageun,

00:24:22.120 --> 00:24:24.310
a person whose power exceeds that of the king.

00:24:24.850 --> 00:24:28.080
That's who really rules the country.

00:24:31.190 --> 00:24:33.260
This would be a place for a popcorn.

00:24:35.960 --> 00:24:38.090
-Your Majesty!
-Queen!

00:24:56.890 --> 00:24:59.640
Sorry, let's continue the event.

00:25:02.290 --> 00:25:06.530
It looks like the queen is tired.
We'll probably end here.

00:25:06.860 --> 00:25:10.560
The night together is the time when the gods
help to conceive an heir.

00:25:10.670 --> 00:25:13.120
We should not indulge in pleasures.

00:25:13.330 --> 00:25:16.040
However, last night I was impatient.

00:25:17.110 --> 00:25:20.140
There is nothing wrong with being happily married.

00:25:20.140 --> 00:25:21.440
How's that?

00:25:21.510 --> 00:25:23.130
What is he talking about here?

00:25:23.680 --> 00:25:26.100
Let's leave it at that then.

00:25:26.250 --> 00:25:30.990
-Thank you, Your Majesty.
-Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:25:35.520 --> 00:25:37.230
You were bluffing, weren't you?

00:25:37.860 --> 00:25:39.380
I don't understand you.

00:25:39.890 --> 00:25:41.830
There was nothing last night.

00:25:41.830 --> 00:25:45.300
You upset me, yes, you drank a lot,

00:25:45.670 --> 00:25:48.270
but how could you forget
what happened on your wedding night?

00:25:49.800 --> 00:25:50.910
What are you talking about?

00:25:50.910 --> 00:25:52.210
I understand everything.

00:25:52.340 --> 00:25:55.570
You've damaged your memory
you may forget about something.

00:25:56.610 --> 00:25:59.170
That can't be true.
There was nothing between us.

00:26:02.280 --> 00:26:03.840
You have been verified.

00:26:04.890 --> 00:26:06.920
Check? What kind of check?

00:26:06.920 --> 00:26:10.190
Virginity check,
there was blood on the bed.

00:26:11.460 --> 00:26:13.350
I have something to do, I'll go.

00:26:17.330 --> 00:26:20.940
Wait a minute! We didn't agree!

00:26:20.940 --> 00:26:24.060
Your Majesty, let's go to the chambers.

00:26:26.510 --> 00:26:29.280
Don't worry, Jang Bong Hwan, he's lying.

00:26:29.440 --> 00:26:32.670
Think for yourself, you would know if something happened.

00:26:32.980 --> 00:26:34.750
There was nothing! Nothing!

00:26:37.220 --> 00:26:40.310
Naturally he doesn't want
so that the people know that he is not hardy.

00:26:40.390 --> 00:26:42.920
And he seems to like to twist the truth.

00:26:42.920 --> 00:26:45.190
And it doesn't matter!
Do you have to be so calculating?

00:26:45.190 --> 00:26:47.090
What the hell is this about checking?
What is this for?

00:26:50.300 --> 00:26:51.470
Wait a minute!

00:26:53.600 --> 00:26:55.060
May I ask a question?

00:26:57.710 --> 00:27:01.710
The girl will know if something happened?

00:27:01.810 --> 00:27:03.070
Something?

00:27:03.180 --> 00:27:05.640
What are you talking about, Your Majesty?

00:27:08.080 --> 00:27:09.610
This one is too young.

00:27:11.150 --> 00:27:13.520
And this one holds celibacy worse than monks.

00:27:15.720 --> 00:27:18.150
Looks like none of you can answer me.

00:27:21.760 --> 00:27:23.060
What a nightmare!

00:27:37.950 --> 00:27:40.720
-Is the child crying because of me?
-Of course not, Your Majesty.

00:27:40.720 --> 00:27:42.920
The wind is cold. Let me close the window.

00:27:42.920 --> 00:27:45.090
-I’m already sweating myself.
-Very cold.

00:27:45.090 --> 00:27:46.320
-It's hot here!
-Catch a cold.

00:27:46.320 --> 00:27:47.810
I'm hot!

00:27:47.820 --> 00:27:49.020
Let's go.

00:27:52.060 --> 00:27:55.560
I can't stop thinking about Cheoljong's words.

00:28:07.890 --> 00:28:09.660
Eat in peace, Your Majesty.

00:28:11.360 --> 00:28:12.930
Seeing the queen

00:28:12.960 --> 00:28:16.000
I realized that she was still not herself.

00:28:16.000 --> 00:28:17.270
How should I say it?

00:28:19.340 --> 00:28:21.240
Overly arrogant?

00:28:21.370 --> 00:28:23.210
She was always brave

00:28:23.210 --> 00:28:26.440
but not so arrogant and fearless.

00:28:26.440 --> 00:28:29.780
She lost her composure during the ceremony.

00:28:29.780 --> 00:28:32.320
I have to teach her some decency.

00:28:32.450 --> 00:28:35.320
You can't show your weakness to others.

00:28:36.620 --> 00:28:38.090
And as for Cho Hwajin...

00:28:38.460 --> 00:28:41.690
Are you sure she was with His Majesty that night?

00:28:41.790 --> 00:28:44.900
Yes, I made sure of this.

00:28:45.100 --> 00:28:47.930
She entered the palace 15 minutes later

00:28:47.930 --> 00:28:49.700
after an accident.

00:28:49.870 --> 00:28:53.940
This is not proof that she tried to harm Her Majesty,

00:28:54.340 --> 00:28:56.510
but you can try to use it.

00:28:57.240 --> 00:28:59.010
Big mystery.

00:28:59.440 --> 00:29:02.150
If she didn't do it, then who?

00:29:04.120 --> 00:29:06.180
Do you think anyone else is involved?

00:29:06.550 --> 00:29:07.790
Maybe.

00:29:08.250 --> 00:29:11.560
It doesn't matter who exactly did it.

00:29:13.790 --> 00:29:16.830
The more important thing is who we need to blame for this.

00:29:18.200 --> 00:29:20.330
Who do we need?

00:29:20.330 --> 00:29:21.670
If we point to a deer

00:29:22.200 --> 00:29:25.470
and let's say it's a horse, then it will be a horse.

00:29:25.640 --> 00:29:30.810
In our case, the deer can actually become a horse.

00:29:31.310 --> 00:29:34.450
Fine. Forget about business for a while

00:29:34.450 --> 00:29:36.380
and eat, Your Majesty.

00:29:37.820 --> 00:29:41.050
Since you make sure I eat well,

00:29:41.050 --> 00:29:44.460
I have to take care of my health.

00:29:44.460 --> 00:29:47.160
I won't let anyone harm you.

00:29:48.430 --> 00:29:49.560
Bon appetit.

00:30:04.310 --> 00:30:07.510
"I hereby confer senior rank within the court

00:30:07.510 --> 00:30:09.010
Cho Hwajin, daughters

00:30:09.010 --> 00:30:11.950
court secretary Cho Daesu from the Pungyang Cho family.

00:30:12.250 --> 00:30:15.550
She was also given the title of royal concubine

00:30:15.550 --> 00:30:17.920
for her beauty and righteousness."

00:30:17.920 --> 00:30:19.660
Pungyang Cho family.

00:30:19.890 --> 00:30:21.960
Their families are feuding, just like them.

00:30:21.960 --> 00:30:24.630
Did she really push Kim So-yeon into the lake?

00:30:25.460 --> 00:30:26.960
She's dangerous

00:30:27.670 --> 00:30:28.930
and that's what attracts me.

00:30:31.740 --> 00:30:33.770
I am grateful to you, Your Majesty.

00:30:36.210 --> 00:30:37.510
Let's be friends.

00:30:41.510 --> 00:30:43.150
I'm on the winning side, of course,

00:30:43.150 --> 00:30:45.650
but I can’t resist such a beauty.

00:30:47.850 --> 00:30:49.050
Let's be friends.

00:30:49.690 --> 00:30:53.320
You'll soon understand that I
sheer perfection, well, except

00:30:53.720 --> 00:30:55.090
a couple of shortcomings.

00:30:58.330 --> 00:31:00.400
Since we've gotten so close,

00:31:00.400 --> 00:31:02.130
can I ask a question?

00:31:02.130 --> 00:31:04.140
There is no one else to ask.

00:31:04.200 --> 00:31:07.810
I'm not sure if I have the wisdom to answer the question.

00:31:07.810 --> 00:31:11.110
You definitely know everything about him. I'm talking about the king.

00:31:25.090 --> 00:31:28.060
Does he often lie?

00:31:29.630 --> 00:31:31.730
I've heard a lot about him.

00:31:32.130 --> 00:31:35.100
And they say the king

00:31:35.100 --> 00:31:36.500
disappears at night.

00:31:37.170 --> 00:31:39.470
Does it disappear at night?

00:31:40.240 --> 00:31:42.370
I haven't heard anything like that.

00:31:42.370 --> 00:31:45.540
A fighter by day, and disappeared by night.

00:31:47.310 --> 00:31:50.450
He said it was like we had a hot night together.

00:31:50.450 --> 00:31:53.420
-He tends to distort...
-Your Majesty.

00:31:53.720 --> 00:31:56.550
With all due respect, this is highly inappropriate.

00:31:56.820 --> 00:32:00.460
Sorry if I offended you. I can't help but think about it.

00:32:01.430 --> 00:32:04.360
I just arrived yesterday, I have a lot on my mind.

00:32:04.560 --> 00:32:07.400
Sorry for taking up time. Go.

00:32:10.740 --> 00:32:11.900
See you.

00:32:21.250 --> 00:32:25.220
I will say one thing for sure. His Majesty is not like that.

00:32:35.360 --> 00:32:39.430
Not like that? Are you saying he's not lying?

00:32:39.930 --> 00:32:43.300
Or doesn't it disappear at night? What are you talking about?

00:32:47.000 --> 00:32:48.510
It couldn't be clearer!

00:32:50.980 --> 00:32:52.240
Crap.

00:34:41.590 --> 00:34:43.050
Robbers!

00:34:43.690 --> 00:34:45.690
Robbers!

00:34:45.790 --> 00:34:47.860
Robbers! There are robbers here!

00:34:48.330 --> 00:34:50.360
Robbers!

00:34:50.960 --> 00:34:52.800
Robbers! They're there!

00:34:55.870 --> 00:34:57.370
Robbers!

00:35:16.020 --> 00:35:18.460
Don't cry. No need.

00:35:18.460 --> 00:35:19.620
Stop it, okay?

00:35:30.800 --> 00:35:33.100
My baby, baby!

00:35:46.250 --> 00:35:47.350
No!

00:36:38.300 --> 00:36:39.470
Your Majesty.

00:36:43.810 --> 00:36:46.540
There was no secret storage either, I checked it at night.

00:36:47.040 --> 00:36:48.680
I searched thoroughly

00:36:48.680 --> 00:36:51.150
all the hidden corners in the palace,

00:36:51.450 --> 00:36:54.050
is it possible that this is hidden in the tiger's den?

00:36:55.050 --> 00:36:58.120
Your Majesty, the queen is here to see you.

00:37:07.100 --> 00:37:09.300
I'm too busy with the affairs of the country.

00:37:09.300 --> 00:37:10.670
So am I on the case.

00:37:10.670 --> 00:37:12.140
There's a lot to talk about.

00:37:17.640 --> 00:37:20.680
So busy you keep it upside down.

00:37:23.310 --> 00:37:26.250
This is not without reason, I thought about a lot of things.

00:37:27.650 --> 00:37:29.990
Think out your thoughts. I'll wait.

00:37:43.570 --> 00:37:45.470
And why are you staring like that?

00:37:46.140 --> 00:37:47.240
You see,

00:37:47.840 --> 00:37:50.370
It's interesting to see how hard you try.

00:37:50.370 --> 00:37:54.240
As a king, I must oversee the affairs of the country.

00:37:54.510 --> 00:37:57.580
Is he talking about “business” on purpose?

00:37:58.150 --> 00:38:00.480
I have appointed a royal concubine as you wished.

00:38:00.680 --> 00:38:02.420
You can sleep in your chambers.

00:38:02.420 --> 00:38:03.590
With pleasure.

00:38:06.360 --> 00:38:08.060
Is there anything you want to tell me?

00:38:08.860 --> 00:38:10.830
You came to me yourself.

00:38:10.830 --> 00:38:13.060
You probably want to say something yourself.

00:38:14.700 --> 00:38:17.000
Since it's just the two of us here, let's be honest.

00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:18.040
Last night we...

00:38:18.040 --> 00:38:20.140
We had a great time.

00:38:22.610 --> 00:38:25.780
Okay, if you keep pretending...

00:38:43.730 --> 00:38:44.830
Lord.

00:38:45.230 --> 00:38:47.230
You're distracting me.

00:38:50.100 --> 00:38:51.470
If you don't want to talk,

00:38:51.470 --> 00:38:53.270
do we use hand signals?

00:38:53.270 --> 00:38:54.470
For example, this one.

00:38:55.340 --> 00:38:56.570
What is this?

00:38:56.840 --> 00:39:00.180
This means that I'm lying about everything.

00:39:00.480 --> 00:39:02.580
What do you say? It's not difficult, is it?

00:39:09.090 --> 00:39:11.960
The king never lies.

00:39:13.660 --> 00:39:14.860
You can go.

00:39:21.400 --> 00:39:23.030
Crap. So infuriating.

00:39:23.500 --> 00:39:25.540
With a straight face he insists that something happened.

00:39:25.540 --> 00:39:28.510
Was it true or not?

00:39:29.910 --> 00:39:32.440
Your Majesty, was it a hard day?

00:39:39.620 --> 00:39:42.420
Oh, it tickles.

00:39:42.850 --> 00:39:44.690
Hey, take it easy.

00:39:45.060 --> 00:39:47.420
I'm ticklish.

00:39:54.430 --> 00:39:55.600
Your Majesty.

00:39:55.770 --> 00:39:59.100
Etiquette classes start today.

00:39:59.270 --> 00:40:01.610
My behavior is already in order.

00:40:05.280 --> 00:40:08.850
This is a crash course in palace etiquette.

00:40:11.080 --> 00:40:12.580
Don't want.

00:40:18.120 --> 00:40:20.790
Order from the Queen Dowager.

00:40:21.360 --> 00:40:22.430
I want to go back

00:40:22.430 --> 00:40:23.990
and not pass the test.

00:40:24.160 --> 00:40:26.060
First, I will defeat the queen.

00:40:29.800 --> 00:40:32.000
You may not know it, but I studied etiquette

00:40:32.000 --> 00:40:34.340
in Cheongaktong for four years.

00:40:35.140 --> 00:40:38.980
Show how well-mannered the graduate is?

00:40:47.250 --> 00:40:51.390
The royal woman is as calm as Buddha.

00:40:58.300 --> 00:41:00.430
It does not create a breeze while walking.

00:41:00.530 --> 00:41:02.530
The candle lights do not flicker.

00:41:20.820 --> 00:41:23.950
She doesn't open her mouth wide when eating.

00:41:24.320 --> 00:41:26.490
and does not bite off in large pieces.

00:41:40.770 --> 00:41:43.110
Embroidery is the best way for a woman

00:41:43.110 --> 00:41:44.680
sort out your thoughts.

00:41:46.740 --> 00:41:49.380
Embroidery. She can do it.

00:41:59.590 --> 00:42:01.630
I'm well brought up.

00:42:01.630 --> 00:42:02.960
Can't I breathe now?

00:42:02.960 --> 00:42:04.260
It's worse here than in Cheongaktong.

00:42:04.260 --> 00:42:05.430
Fuck it.

00:42:14.440 --> 00:42:16.470
How to eat such beauty?

00:42:17.240 --> 00:42:19.910
First, watch and enjoy.

00:42:21.010 --> 00:42:23.580
Are we watching? Looks like

00:42:23.580 --> 00:42:25.350
you stuff everything into your mouth.

00:42:29.320 --> 00:42:31.720
You used to like it.

00:42:33.490 --> 00:42:35.190
Hongyong, try it. Wider your mouth.

00:42:46.840 --> 00:42:48.470
What happened, Your Majesty?

00:42:55.080 --> 00:42:57.180
Is this Kim So-yeon's memories?

00:42:58.420 --> 00:42:59.720
Heart...

00:43:01.750 --> 00:43:02.890
Poisoned.

00:43:02.890 --> 00:43:04.590
Get the doctor here quickly!

00:43:04.590 --> 00:43:05.860
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:43:06.220 --> 00:43:08.160
-Spit it out.
-Your Majesty.

00:43:08.490 --> 00:43:11.390
-Your Majesty.
-It's not pain.

00:43:13.030 --> 00:43:17.300
Is this woman in love with Cheoljong?

00:43:30.210 --> 00:43:32.050
You must love me.

00:43:37.450 --> 00:43:38.720
His eyes.

00:43:39.720 --> 00:43:41.860
This is more than hatred. He despises her.

00:43:44.260 --> 00:43:45.600
Please, Your Majesty.

00:43:51.570 --> 00:43:53.870
I like snacks more than alcohol itself.

00:43:54.100 --> 00:43:55.440
And good.

00:43:55.470 --> 00:43:58.110
All alcohol is in your favor.

00:43:58.110 --> 00:44:01.550
He wasn't going to share this night with me.

00:44:01.550 --> 00:44:03.580
So he tried to get me drunk.

00:44:03.950 --> 00:44:06.020
We were thinking the same thing.

00:44:06.980 --> 00:44:10.120
Now you have to do your best
try to produce an heir.

00:44:10.120 --> 00:44:12.760
Come to your senses, Your Majesty.

00:44:12.760 --> 00:44:14.460
Bring water!

00:44:14.490 --> 00:44:15.490
To fool the Kim family

00:44:15.490 --> 00:44:17.160
forcing them to sleep,

00:44:17.160 --> 00:44:20.060
Cheoljong lied.

00:44:26.500 --> 00:44:29.210
Hongyeon. There was nothing!

00:44:31.240 --> 00:44:33.410
Thinking about this almost drove me crazy.

00:44:33.410 --> 00:44:35.950
I trust myself, but not that idiot.

00:44:35.950 --> 00:44:37.080
However...

00:44:40.750 --> 00:44:41.990
What are you doing here?

00:44:59.340 --> 00:45:03.140
-More. Pull it up higher.
-Yes.

00:45:05.540 --> 00:45:09.050
That's how tiring it is to maintain your position.

00:45:09.050 --> 00:45:12.120
Decrepancy means you have become weaker.

00:45:12.250 --> 00:45:14.650
If you do this twice a day,

00:45:14.650 --> 00:45:17.620
wrinkles will not get deeper.

00:45:18.050 --> 00:45:21.760
It's clear. You try so hard.

00:45:22.090 --> 00:45:23.890
Why did you come to me?

00:45:24.330 --> 00:45:26.560
At your insistence, having received etiquette lessons,

00:45:26.560 --> 00:45:29.100
I realized what I should do

00:45:29.100 --> 00:45:30.800
a real queen.

00:45:31.330 --> 00:45:32.870
I'm very happy.

00:45:34.570 --> 00:45:37.310
- Enough, stop.
-Okay, okay.

00:45:44.450 --> 00:45:46.180
So, yesterday we went to bed with His Majesty,

00:45:46.520 --> 00:45:48.820
but it’s like all the strength has been pumped out of me,

00:45:48.820 --> 00:45:51.020
I became all so lethargic.

00:45:51.490 --> 00:45:54.060
I kept wondering what the reason was, and I understood!

00:45:56.330 --> 00:45:59.030
This is because the reservoirs have been drained.

00:45:59.130 --> 00:46:01.500
That’s why my feminine principle has weakened.

00:46:02.000 --> 00:46:03.870
If only they were filled with water again,

00:46:03.870 --> 00:46:05.900
I would immediately carry the prince.

00:46:05.900 --> 00:46:07.170
Excluded.

00:46:08.170 --> 00:46:11.470
- Damn it.
-We barely saved you.

00:46:11.470 --> 00:46:13.410
In a good way, everyone who allowed

00:46:13.410 --> 00:46:16.350
something like this should happen, he should be executed.

00:46:16.510 --> 00:46:18.780
However, on the eve of such a happy event,

00:46:18.780 --> 00:46:21.520
we showed mercy and did not shed blood.

00:46:22.790 --> 00:46:26.820
But since you want to fill the ponds
water, all those responsible will have to be punished.

00:46:27.120 --> 00:46:30.490
Who was there? Hongyong,
court lady Choi. Who else?

00:46:31.460 --> 00:46:35.130
All those involved will be punished with all severity.

00:46:35.200 --> 00:46:38.270
What a wicked one. This is not your sweet neighbor's grandmother.

00:46:39.240 --> 00:46:40.400
What if I perform

00:46:41.100 --> 00:46:42.740
marital duty for three whole nights,

00:46:42.740 --> 00:46:44.610
to conceive a son for the king as soon as possible?

00:46:45.510 --> 00:46:47.340
Will you fill the ponds with water for this?

00:46:47.540 --> 00:46:48.680
Seven nights.

00:46:49.480 --> 00:46:50.650
Five.

00:46:50.710 --> 00:46:53.750
Listen here. Everyone who was involved...

00:46:53.750 --> 00:46:54.880
Seven nights.

00:46:55.390 --> 00:46:56.690
Seven is a good number.

00:46:57.150 --> 00:46:59.720
If you promise to fill the ponds with water,

00:46:59.720 --> 00:47:02.360
I will do everything to conceive a prince.

00:47:05.100 --> 00:47:08.370
Even a little boy, even a little dog, just to come back.

00:47:28.450 --> 00:47:30.520
Concubine Cho has come to greet you.

00:47:35.790 --> 00:47:40.260
Wow, you're so attractive
and graceful, just as they describe you.

00:47:40.900 --> 00:47:45.240
His Majesty has an eye for beauties.

00:47:45.900 --> 00:47:47.540
You flatter me.

00:47:56.880 --> 00:47:58.250
This is a gift.

00:47:58.520 --> 00:48:00.620
Something you'll need in the palace.

00:48:00.620 --> 00:48:02.520
There is no way to do this without this.

00:48:04.290 --> 00:48:05.860
Take a look.

00:48:20.970 --> 00:48:23.140
Life in the palace is not at all easy.

00:48:23.440 --> 00:48:25.380
There is no one to rely on here.

00:48:25.380 --> 00:48:28.910
Here you can forget about quiet days.

00:48:29.350 --> 00:48:33.250
Oh yes, tell me which one
day and year you were born?

00:48:33.980 --> 00:48:37.950
Do you know what to do
to conceive a son for His Majesty?

00:48:39.860 --> 00:48:42.030
What am I talking about?

00:48:42.030 --> 00:48:44.890
First you need to check
compatibility with His Majesty.

00:48:47.160 --> 00:48:51.900
Contact me if you need a powerful talisman.

00:48:53.070 --> 00:48:57.240
I know a shaman who knows
the use of evil eyes and curses.

00:48:57.340 --> 00:48:59.880
Last time I was very pleased with her.

00:49:00.040 --> 00:49:02.910
Your Majesty, please forgive me.

00:49:02.910 --> 00:49:05.920
But I'm here to
care for the good of His Majesty.

00:49:07.580 --> 00:49:10.650
Apparently I misunderstood something.

00:49:12.220 --> 00:49:13.990
Sorry, Queen Mother.

00:49:14.360 --> 00:49:16.530
Perhaps I expressed myself too harshly.

00:49:16.560 --> 00:49:20.160
Everything is fine. Don't take it to heart.

00:49:22.800 --> 00:49:26.040
By the way, about the heart. These are your first days in the palace,

00:49:26.340 --> 00:49:28.840
and you will have to vegetate alone.

00:49:29.170 --> 00:49:32.340
What a shame. What are you planning to do?

00:49:33.210 --> 00:49:34.380
What?

00:49:34.580 --> 00:49:37.480
For the next seven days His Majesty will

00:49:37.480 --> 00:49:39.580
sleep in Her Majesty's chambers.

00:49:39.750 --> 00:49:41.950
After all, everything is fine with them anyway,

00:49:41.950 --> 00:49:44.950
peace and quiet.

00:49:45.390 --> 00:49:47.890
So they will spend seven more nights together.

00:49:48.760 --> 00:49:50.990
But you don't have to worry.

00:49:51.160 --> 00:49:53.360
I am sure that during these seven days the feelings of His Majesty

00:49:53.360 --> 00:49:56.130
they won't cool down on you.

00:50:24.760 --> 00:50:26.400
Someday you too will lose

00:50:27.560 --> 00:50:30.200
person dear to you.

00:50:51.290 --> 00:50:52.420
Madam.

00:51:02.530 --> 00:51:05.500
Looks like I ruined the sheet
there is nothing to fix here.

00:51:06.740 --> 00:51:09.040
It's a pity, but I'll have to write everything again.

00:51:11.370 --> 00:51:15.310
You are so beautiful that you could easily become a queen.

00:51:16.250 --> 00:51:18.650
The only advantage the queen has is a good pedigree,

00:51:18.650 --> 00:51:20.550
and she spins His Majesty as she wants.

00:51:20.550 --> 00:51:21.720
Remember.

00:51:22.550 --> 00:51:25.260
The queen has the same status as the king.

00:51:25.560 --> 00:51:27.720
Remember, the higher the status, the greater the responsibility,

00:51:27.790 --> 00:51:29.390
watch what you say.

00:51:29.390 --> 00:51:30.930
Don’t go to a fortune teller here, it’s her doing.

00:51:30.930 --> 00:51:32.960
It was she who whispered to the ladies of the court about seven nights.

00:51:32.960 --> 00:51:35.600
She also accused you of something you didn’t do.

00:51:35.700 --> 00:51:38.530
What a shame that you ended up there
at the most inopportune moment!

00:51:44.740 --> 00:51:47.340
I haven’t gotten used to life in the palace yet.

00:51:47.840 --> 00:51:49.280
My tongue is my enemy.

00:51:50.350 --> 00:51:52.180
Forgive me, madam.

00:51:55.420 --> 00:51:59.790
How can I earn His Majesty's favor?

00:52:12.800 --> 00:52:14.540
She herself told me to spend the night in my chambers.

00:52:14.540 --> 00:52:17.640
And then she turned to the dowager queen
with a completely different request.

00:52:17.710 --> 00:52:20.580
How difficult it is to understand a lady's heart.

00:52:21.380 --> 00:52:24.450
Listen, I want something for you
suggest. You don't mind, do you?

00:52:24.950 --> 00:52:28.080
How can I refuse you?

00:52:28.720 --> 00:52:31.420
I suggest sticking to social distancing.

00:52:31.420 --> 00:52:33.560
-No really.
-You said that you wouldn’t refuse.

00:52:33.560 --> 00:52:35.090
I don't understand the meaning of your words.

00:52:35.260 --> 00:52:37.160
Didn’t understand anything, but already gave up?

00:52:37.160 --> 00:52:39.730
That's why I refused because I didn't understand anything.

00:52:42.470 --> 00:52:44.170
Well then listen, I’ll explain now.

00:52:44.470 --> 00:52:48.240
Social distancing -
This is when everyone is on their own.

00:52:48.240 --> 00:52:49.470
Which is very good.

00:52:49.510 --> 00:52:51.910
Let's say we kind of have to sleep together.

00:52:51.910 --> 00:52:54.810
In fact, you sleep at your place, and I sleep at mine.

00:52:55.450 --> 00:52:57.010
This is distancing.

00:52:59.450 --> 00:53:00.720
I'm still against it.

00:53:01.150 --> 00:53:02.950
But why?

00:53:04.320 --> 00:53:07.390
I don't know why, but I don't like it.

00:53:08.020 --> 00:53:09.890
What a damn pervert.

00:53:12.500 --> 00:53:15.570
Well, you need to speak to perverts in their own language.

00:53:18.230 --> 00:53:20.870
You know, I don't remember anything from last night.

00:53:21.100 --> 00:53:22.740
Maybe we can repeat it?

00:53:23.340 --> 00:53:25.410
Let's light it up properly.

00:53:26.610 --> 00:53:27.810
Shall we light it?

00:53:27.810 --> 00:53:29.250
Let's have a hot night.

00:53:29.750 --> 00:53:30.880
Tonight

00:53:32.020 --> 00:53:34.480
it will be our first time.

00:53:41.620 --> 00:53:42.890
Well then...

00:53:52.640 --> 00:53:56.040
What are you doing? Come on quickly. They'll notice you.

00:53:56.040 --> 00:53:58.940
It was not proper for a king to sneak around like a thief.

00:53:59.480 --> 00:54:00.640
What a moron.

00:54:02.580 --> 00:54:03.980
What? Court Lady Choi?

00:54:13.990 --> 00:54:16.190
We could be in big trouble, Your Majesty.

00:54:16.290 --> 00:54:18.590
How can I become a good ruler?

00:54:18.590 --> 00:54:20.960
what if I don’t know how ordinary people live?

00:54:20.960 --> 00:54:22.530
May your thoughts be noble

00:54:23.000 --> 00:54:24.470
the idea is still too dangerous.

00:54:24.470 --> 00:54:27.240
Of course, I’m ready to give my life for you, but still...

00:54:27.240 --> 00:54:28.400
Where's the map?

00:54:32.080 --> 00:54:34.010
-This time...
-Name plate?

00:54:36.580 --> 00:54:38.010
I should stop you.

00:54:38.250 --> 00:54:39.520
It turns out that my name is

00:54:40.280 --> 00:54:41.780
Lee Sanman?

00:54:42.850 --> 00:54:44.720
What is this creepy name?

00:54:45.250 --> 00:54:47.090
Sen as "to contemplate" and Man as "as to "try".

00:54:47.090 --> 00:54:50.530
A contemplator who tries for the good
people. You can't think of a better name.

00:54:51.460 --> 00:54:54.800
Well, let's say. That's not my name and that's okay.

00:54:55.300 --> 00:54:57.800
-When does the curfew start there?
-At the hour of the mouse

00:54:57.800 --> 00:54:59.500
the guards ring the bells 28 times,

00:54:59.500 --> 00:55:00.900
and then the gates are closed.

00:55:01.940 --> 00:55:03.910
The bells are ringing, that is?

00:55:04.540 --> 00:55:06.540
At the hour of the mouse?

00:55:08.750 --> 00:55:11.250
It sucks. The hour when all the fun begins.

00:55:12.650 --> 00:55:13.750
Well, nothing.

00:55:14.320 --> 00:55:15.950
I promise to be back by then.

00:55:17.250 --> 00:55:18.320
Well, no.

00:55:18.320 --> 00:55:19.920
I'll do anything

00:55:19.920 --> 00:55:22.090
but I won’t let you leave.

00:55:33.140 --> 00:55:34.240
Hongyeon.

00:55:35.240 --> 00:55:36.940
What kind of person am I anyway?

00:55:38.370 --> 00:55:40.080
you always

00:55:41.080 --> 00:55:44.680
kind and cheerful.

00:55:44.680 --> 00:55:46.920
Extremely friendly

00:55:46.920 --> 00:55:48.720
and always very smiling.

00:55:50.350 --> 00:55:52.420
You understand that I better know

00:55:52.520 --> 00:55:54.360
the truth from you than from someone else.

00:55:55.020 --> 00:55:56.130
It's true.

00:55:57.660 --> 00:55:58.790
OK.

00:56:02.000 --> 00:56:04.400
So, one day you were reading a book.

00:56:10.910 --> 00:56:13.440
It's simply impossible to read here!

00:56:14.740 --> 00:56:16.950
You're breathing so noisily

00:56:16.950 --> 00:56:19.180
that I will soon go deaf!

00:56:20.520 --> 00:56:23.790
Come here! Take him away and give him a good spanking!

00:56:24.150 --> 00:56:26.220
I have long-term problems with my nose.

00:56:26.220 --> 00:56:27.490
Have mercy, Your Highness!

00:56:27.490 --> 00:56:28.790
Let's go.

00:56:42.470 --> 00:56:45.040
You're off by one fourth note.

00:56:45.880 --> 00:56:48.080
Did the bear step on your ear or what?

00:56:48.410 --> 00:56:49.980
And you still call yourself a teacher?

00:56:51.580 --> 00:56:52.680
Come here!

00:56:53.550 --> 00:56:55.220
Flog this idiot!

00:56:56.550 --> 00:56:58.050
Is it true? It can't be!

00:57:01.460 --> 00:57:02.630
Is it funny to you?

00:57:03.390 --> 00:57:05.600
Apparently there is nothing to do.

00:57:06.660 --> 00:57:09.700
Come here! Take these two away and give them a good beating!

00:57:10.430 --> 00:57:11.600
Just one breath

00:57:11.600 --> 00:57:13.070
and you are already losing your temper.

00:57:13.070 --> 00:57:14.070
It's worth putting on perfume

00:57:14.070 --> 00:57:15.340
accused of trying to seduce the king.

00:57:15.340 --> 00:57:16.740
We walk noisily - it’s bad,

00:57:16.740 --> 00:57:18.370
We walk silently - it’s even worse.

00:57:18.370 --> 00:57:19.940
You will always find something to complain about.

00:57:19.940 --> 00:57:23.180
Every little thing makes you angry.

00:57:23.610 --> 00:57:26.580
That's why they called you a viper.

00:57:31.650 --> 00:57:32.820
Oh, sorry.

00:57:34.220 --> 00:57:36.060
I just wanted to fill you in on the details,

00:57:36.060 --> 00:57:37.590
but I got a little carried away.

00:57:37.990 --> 00:57:41.100
It looks like a lot of people wanted to drown this girl.

00:57:41.730 --> 00:57:43.670
So that's why the ladies of the court...

00:57:44.530 --> 00:57:46.900
They just don't know who you really are.

00:57:48.070 --> 00:57:49.310
Do you know?

00:57:49.710 --> 00:57:50.910
Of course.

00:57:51.140 --> 00:57:54.140
I have been serving you since childhood.

00:57:54.480 --> 00:57:56.480
And I know that your heart is good.

00:57:56.880 --> 00:57:58.510
And that you are smart beyond your years.

00:57:58.510 --> 00:58:00.950
And since you have something in mind,
you will certainly achieve your goal.

00:58:00.950 --> 00:58:02.320
You are an example for me.

00:58:04.520 --> 00:58:07.760
Although you are often in the palace
feel lonely.

00:58:08.760 --> 00:58:12.830
After all, His Majesty is after every skirt.

00:58:15.230 --> 00:58:17.470
This lady was not so lonely.

00:58:18.470 --> 00:58:20.500
Once there was a person nearby who understood her so well.

00:58:21.240 --> 00:58:22.940
Lady?

00:58:23.040 --> 00:58:26.180
This means that you brighten up my loneliness.

00:58:28.340 --> 00:58:29.610
What are you talking about?

00:58:32.550 --> 00:58:35.180
Don't worry, Hongyeon. Get a good night's sleep.

00:58:35.750 --> 00:58:38.990
For your sake, I will try not to get caught.

00:58:41.090 --> 00:58:43.060
I will kill you all!

00:58:43.800 --> 00:58:46.070
Better take your other eye, you bastards!

00:58:46.330 --> 00:58:50.040
I won't let you take my wife and child away like some kind of slaves!

00:58:50.640 --> 00:58:51.840
If you don't pay taxes,

00:58:51.840 --> 00:58:53.340
then give them to us!

00:58:53.340 --> 00:58:54.970
This scoundrel is still a sinner!

00:58:54.970 --> 00:58:56.730
My only sin is

00:58:56.980 --> 00:59:01.310
Let a child live in such a terrible world!

00:59:05.220 --> 00:59:06.920
Don't come any closer! Don't come near me.

00:59:07.490 --> 00:59:10.190
This madman is guilty of treason!

00:59:10.190 --> 00:59:12.460
If killing scoundrels like you is treason, I will do it.

00:59:12.460 --> 00:59:14.630
Yes! I'll be happy to do this!

00:59:15.390 --> 00:59:16.730
Expensive!

00:59:19.430 --> 00:59:21.070
Don't do this.

00:59:22.270 --> 00:59:24.000
I know you're upset.

00:59:25.670 --> 00:59:28.900
These scoundrels want us dead.

00:59:29.340 --> 00:59:31.340
Why should I stop?

00:59:33.810 --> 00:59:34.940
Damhyang.

00:59:42.590 --> 00:59:46.420
Make way! Out of the way! Make way!

00:59:49.260 --> 00:59:50.920
What's going on here?

00:59:51.360 --> 00:59:52.590
What should we do?

01:00:18.360 --> 01:00:20.630
Father, you are back.

01:00:20.860 --> 01:00:23.150
Yes, how was your trip?

01:00:24.130 --> 01:00:26.170
Sorry I missed it

01:00:26.170 --> 01:00:27.360
such a joyful event.

01:00:28.070 --> 01:00:29.840
Have you made your decision?

01:00:29.840 --> 01:00:31.690
What are you leaning towards?

01:00:32.810 --> 01:00:34.940
I decided to follow my dream.

01:00:35.670 --> 01:00:38.440
But how far I'll go, I don't know yet.

01:00:38.680 --> 01:00:40.000
How far?

01:00:43.080 --> 01:00:44.170
Right.

01:00:44.620 --> 01:00:46.940
I trust you and won't rush you.

01:00:47.790 --> 01:00:51.710
But something happened in your absence.

01:00:52.320 --> 01:00:54.730
The queen fell into the lake

01:00:54.730 --> 01:00:56.590
the night before the wedding.

01:00:57.260 --> 01:01:00.330
She was unconscious all day

01:01:00.330 --> 01:01:02.770
so the wedding had to be postponed.

01:01:03.040 --> 01:01:04.860
How is Her Highness now?

01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:06.710
Is she okay?

01:01:17.880 --> 01:01:19.070
Stand!

01:01:24.960 --> 01:01:26.920
I haven't seen you before.

01:01:27.390 --> 01:01:29.960
Judging by the way you're looking around...

01:01:30.700 --> 01:01:33.170
-Well...
-First time in the palace?

01:01:33.170 --> 01:01:34.630
Apparently lost.

01:01:35.970 --> 01:01:37.540
I also got lost for the first time.

01:01:37.770 --> 01:01:38.900
This is true.

01:01:45.110 --> 01:01:47.810
But you look somehow familiar.

01:01:51.780 --> 01:01:53.350
Expensive clothes

01:01:53.350 --> 01:01:56.380
and unshakable self-confidence.

01:01:58.220 --> 01:01:59.560
Must be from a noble family.

01:02:00.160 --> 01:02:02.150
I was going to say the same thing.

01:02:02.460 --> 01:02:04.700
You are that famous son.

01:02:04.700 --> 01:02:06.500
Attractive and from a respected family.

01:02:06.500 --> 01:02:08.030
Smart and talented.

01:02:08.030 --> 01:02:10.070
I've heard about you. Your name...

01:02:10.070 --> 01:02:11.190
Kim Hwan

01:02:11.900 --> 01:02:13.810
from the Andon clan Kim.

01:02:14.140 --> 01:02:15.640
Here are those on, her relative.

01:02:15.640 --> 01:02:17.270
Am I that famous?

01:02:18.510 --> 01:02:19.980
Certainly.

01:02:20.210 --> 01:02:22.710
Ask anyone on the street: everyone knows.

01:02:23.150 --> 01:02:25.250
Such an honor to meet you.

01:02:25.520 --> 01:02:27.340
I was about to go out too.

01:02:27.520 --> 01:02:28.710
Let's go together.

01:02:29.420 --> 01:02:31.480
I came from the other side.

01:02:31.890 --> 01:02:33.460
It's dark, so I got it wrong.

01:02:39.730 --> 01:02:41.360
Blow and he's killed.

01:02:42.500 --> 01:02:44.570
How can you talk so much?

01:02:44.570 --> 01:02:46.010
He didn't pause for a second.

01:02:46.010 --> 01:02:48.960
That's why it's a little creepy here.

01:02:49.480 --> 01:02:54.170
And that's why His Majesty has nightmares every night.

01:02:55.110 --> 01:02:56.250
Nightmares?

01:02:57.450 --> 01:03:00.650
Since His Majesty returned from Ganghwa,

01:03:00.650 --> 01:03:03.120
he has the same nightmare every night.

01:03:03.120 --> 01:03:04.320
About

01:03:04.960 --> 01:03:07.630
how he is accused of treason

01:03:07.930 --> 01:03:09.150
and beheaded.

01:03:14.800 --> 01:03:16.140
We apologize that we didn't recognize you.

01:03:16.140 --> 01:03:18.860
Not scary. So many people
pass through this gate.

01:03:21.370 --> 01:03:22.770
Lee Sanman

01:03:30.680 --> 01:03:33.250
On the occasion of our acquaintance, I would like

01:03:33.250 --> 01:03:35.450
visit the kisen's house.

01:03:35.450 --> 01:03:36.820
Which one is the best?

01:03:37.460 --> 01:03:40.420
Oktajeong. This one is the best.

01:03:41.260 --> 01:03:43.800
Girls laugh like this

01:03:43.800 --> 01:03:46.960
when you mention the jade tablet. Therefore, Oktajeong.

01:03:49.100 --> 01:03:50.570
Show me the way.

01:03:50.770 --> 01:03:52.440
Look how bright the moon is.

01:03:52.440 --> 01:03:55.040
A great night to have fun.

01:03:57.580 --> 01:03:58.730
Here.

01:03:59.010 --> 01:04:00.110
Let's go.

01:04:00.510 --> 01:04:02.480
-Easy work.
-Yes.

01:04:04.280 --> 01:04:06.690
It seems we're the same age

01:04:06.890 --> 01:04:10.750
and our hobbies are similar. I'm so glad we met.

01:04:11.220 --> 01:04:14.790
Oh yes. You haven't told me your name yet.

01:04:14.930 --> 01:04:16.060
What's your name?

01:04:16.430 --> 01:04:18.060
I'm Lee Senman.

01:04:22.900 --> 01:04:26.670
Lee Saengman as "Loser in this life."

01:04:31.140 --> 01:04:32.270
Don't blame me!

01:04:37.850 --> 01:04:39.480
What's your name?

01:04:42.090 --> 01:04:43.380
Yes, that's it.

01:04:49.160 --> 01:04:51.320
My apologies.

01:05:00.740 --> 01:05:02.670
You are a woman.

01:05:03.340 --> 01:05:05.580
What are you talking about? I'm definitely a man.

01:05:05.580 --> 01:05:09.520
We do not serve women.

01:05:16.090 --> 01:05:20.020
Girls, greet the young master!

01:05:40.850 --> 01:05:42.210
Like this!

01:05:48.050 --> 01:05:50.590
It's a great honor to meet you.

01:05:58.630 --> 01:06:00.860
Let me pour you...

01:06:06.110 --> 01:06:08.860
I don't drink more than three cups of wine a day.

01:06:09.310 --> 01:06:10.780
I've already drunk two

01:06:10.780 --> 01:06:13.670
and I want to share the last one with my friend.

01:06:15.710 --> 01:06:18.170
He doesn't change his mind.

01:06:20.350 --> 01:06:24.460
His son recently passed the civil servant's exam.

01:06:25.190 --> 01:06:26.420
Congratulations.

01:06:26.730 --> 01:06:29.390
Although he is capable,

01:06:29.390 --> 01:06:31.900
he was unable to get a good position in Hanyang.

01:06:32.830 --> 01:06:35.600
If you can help him, I will gladly pay you,

01:06:35.600 --> 01:06:37.900
how much do you say?

01:06:39.840 --> 01:06:41.770
You're asking me to sell

01:06:41.970 --> 01:06:44.940
the position of a government official for money?

01:06:45.180 --> 01:06:47.440
Well, I meant...

01:06:48.110 --> 01:06:50.750
I just wanted to express my gratitude.

